===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{lb|en|music genre}} A [[genre]] of Germanic music (especially Bavarian music) typically involving [[brass]] instruments.
# {{lb|en|music}} A [[bassline]] characteristic of such music, alternating lower and higher [[note]]s or [[chord]]s on the beat, or in a mid-high-low-high sequence.
